    H --> I{"System Python passes every capability check?"}
    I -->|Yes| O["Resolve explicit inputs and hash exact venv contents"]
    I -->|No| K{"Compatible managed Python cached?"}
    K -->|Yes| O
    K -->|No| L{"Python installation allowed?"}
    L -->|No| Z
    L -->|Yes| M["Install managed Python with uv"]
    M --> O
    O --> P{"Complete matching hashed venv exists?"}
    P -->|Yes| Q["Reuse hashed venv"]
    P -->|No| R["Create node_modules/.pyfig/venvs/hash"]
